  <Docs>
    <summary>The security configuration to use when performing network communications.</summary>
    <remarks>
      <para>The security configuration to use when performing network communications.</para>
      <para>A NetworkSecurityConfig can specify security requirements for all network communications, or for communications with a specific domain or localhost connections.</para>
      <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/security/net/config/NetworkSecurityConfig" title="Reference documentation">Android reference for <code>android.security.net.config.NetworkSecurityConfig</code>.</a></format></para>
